            "snippets": [
              "# US 'plans next steps' after trade talks with China end - as it happened\nThis article is more than 7 years old\n\nHopes of a ceasefire in the trade war between Washington and Beijing are boosting stocks, but car sales in China have fallen\n\n- Latest: US issues statement after talks in Beijing\n- FTSE 100 has hit a five-week high\n\nEarlier:\n\n- Introduction: Talks conclude after three days\n- Car sales in China are down",
